{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Can you find happiness?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to our <i>dark</i> story of <i>sorrowful</i> love...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imagine the picture - a young couple moves into a new apartment after the wedding, but the husband has to leave immediately on a business trip for an indefinite period. Not the best honeymoon, we say. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But these are not all the problems that have fallen on your head - some strange woman has started to visit your new apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loneliness, confusion, and anxiety - this is how we begin the story. But how it ends is <i>up to you</i>...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Invisible Wall Features:</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick but deep story (20-30 minutes);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well-developed psychological horror;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Touching dark design;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several game endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3515690?t=1742925730","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3515690?t=1742925730","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515690/b2bd611e6cc72c9e3101f7a3f2a49fd5ba8a1244/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742925730","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515690/b2bd611e6cc72c9e3101f7a3f2a49fd5ba8a1244/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742925730","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":"The game contains scenes of violence: the character engages in aggressive actions, resulting in injury with visible bleeding."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Can you find happiness?</s